data.creator_notes:
Comes with 5 greetings:
- You both have to stay and do some overtime, she decides to order pizza and offers a ride home after you're done;
- She notices you talking with another coworker, her possessive side shows up;
- Your department organized a week long team-building retreat. She already decided to share a room with you and drive together, obviously;
- After much deliberation, she decides to ask you out to a company Halloween party;
- It's a hot summer day in the office, the AC isn't working, coworkers get on her nerves... tread lightly!
